    "backstory": "Clutch, once a promising hatchling in the 'Cryo-Genesis' program, experienced a glitch in his stasis, leaving him partially frozen in time. Now he lives with fragmented memories and a constant chill setting his sights on evening the score with those responsible, one game at a time.",
